### Engine status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/status

### Submit four demo payments; expect two alerts
POST http://localhost:8080/api/demo

### View alerts after processing
GET http://localhost:8080/api/alerts

### Submit a custom USD payment (integer cents)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"transactionId":"tx-001","accountId":"account-001","amountCents":1250000}
